<title>DENMARK: Tele Danmark H1 96 profit down.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark H1 96 profit down.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>					  (billion crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result	  2.178     vs  2.721</p>
<p> Group net result		   1.340  vs  1.758</p>
<p> Group net turnover		10.943  vs  9.410*</p>
<p> Net financial items     292  million  vs  460 million</p>
<p>*revised from 9.328 NOTE - Full name of Danish partially privatised telecommunications group is Tele Danmark A/S. It said in a statement that full year 1996 results might be lower than 1995's 3.494 billion crowns. The result was somewhat below average analysts' expectations. --Steve Weizman,Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
